<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <record id="action_store_crowdfunding_dashboard" model="ir.actions.act_window">
        <field name="name">品牌众筹看板</field>
        <field name="res_model">store.crowdfunding.project</field>
        <field name="view_mode">pivot,graph,tree</field>
        <field name="domain">[]</field>
        <field name="context">
            {
                'search_default_group_by_state': 1,
                'search_default_group_by_company': 1,
                'search_default_group_by_brand': 0,
                'graph_measure': 'amount_confirmed'
            }
        </field>
        <field name="help" type="html">
            <p>品牌方专用的众筹洞察看板，可快速查看各门店的募集进度与执行状态。</p>
            <p>通过切换透视表与图表，分析募集金额、执行率与门店贡献度。</p>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
